  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    87.3,
    467.9,
    530.7,
    483.4
   ],
   "text": "pounds. The additional 5,000 pounds had an adverse effect on the vessel’s stability, causing",
   "conf": 0.9888,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    86.9,
    481.8,
    515.6,
    496.6
   ],
   "text": "it to sit even lower in the water, completely submerging the aft scuppers and causing 4-6",
